cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MOKEapp in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "MOKEapp: control and analysis software for longitudinal and polar MOKE magnetometers"
abstract: >-
  Desktop application that runs a longitudinal or polar magneto-optical Kerr effect (MOKE) magnetometer:
  a Keithley multimeter reads the photodetector and an NI DAQ programs a Kepco bipolar supply that
  drives the electromagnet. It measures hysteresis loops point by point with safety checks, saves
  self-describing CSV files, calibrates the field with a Hall probe and analyses the loops
  (coercive field, drift correction, odd/even symmetrisation).
type: software
